bundle.zero input: six padded159744-byte apps, then padded4096-byte prefix,
then padded65536-byte runtime body; total1028096 bytes. The writer checks all
headers, sizes, architecture/order, reserved fields and zero padding, then
publishes one complete1MiB bundle. Error1=input I/O;2=short/invalid input;
3=excess input;4=output I/O. No output is emitted before validation completes.

